hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"46","“Did Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) dye [his hair]?” He said: “Yes!”"
"47","\I saw Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) come out of his house shaking his head"," for he had performed the major ritual ablution"," and on his head there was some trace of henna.\"" (Or he said: saffron. The Shaikh doubted this.)"""
"48","\I saw the hair of Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace)dyed.”"""
"49","'Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn 'Uqail also informed us: \I saw the hair of Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) dyed in the presence of Anas ibn Malik.\"""""
"50","\Color the edges of the eyelids with antimony [ithmid]"," for it clears the vision and makes the eyelashes grow!” He also maintained that the Prophet (Allah bless him and give him peace) had a kohl jar from which he used to apply kohl to his eyelashes every night"," three times in this [eye]","and three times in that."""
